  "discord": "The ARC Daily Digest · Early edition — ARC-AGI-2\nARCward Intelligence reaches thirteenth at 54.17 and enters provisional gold. The gold line rises to 49.03, with Kajetan Schweighofer holding the last place. Tufa remains first ahead of Chen. Odd Dice’s Japanese author describes how an improved score can still lose ground in a moving field.\nhttps://arc.markbarney.net/news/2026-10-14-morning-arc-2",
